==Organization==
The following were key milestones in the organization of the tournament:
*The official emblem of the tournament, as well as the match schedule, was unveiled on 11 April 2017.<ref name="emblem"/>

==Squads==
{{main|2017 FIFA Club World Cup squads}}

Each team had to name a 23-man squad (three of whom must be goalkeepers). Injury replacements were allowed until 24 hours before the team's first match.<ref name="regulations"/> The official squads were confirmed by FIFA on 30 November 2017.<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.fifa.com/clubworldcup/news/y=2017/m=11/news=uae-2017-squad-lists-revealed-2921983.html|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20171202193241/http://www.fifa.com/clubworldcup/news/y=2017/m=11/news=uae-2017-squad-lists-revealed-2921983.html|url-status=dead|archive-date=2 December 2017|title=UAE 2017 squad lists revealed|publisher=FIFA.com}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=http://www.fifadata.com/documents/FCWC/2017/pdf/FCWC_2017_Squadlists.pdf|title=FIFA Club World Cup UAE 2017 List Of Players|publisher=FIFA.com|access-date=5 December 2017|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20171223004345/http://www.fifadata.com/documents/FCWC/2017/pdf/FCWC_2017_Squadlists.pdf|archive-date=23 December 2017|url-status=dead}}</ref>

==Matches==
The draw was held on 9 October 2017, 12:00 [[Gulf Standard Time|GST]] ([[UTC+04:00|UTC+4]]), at [[Abu Dhabi]] to determine the matchups of the second round, and which teams the two second round winners would play in the semi-finals.<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.fifa.com/clubworldcup/news/y=2017/m=10/news=draw-lays-out-path-to-club-world-cup-glory-2911298.html|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20171009143738/http://www.fifa.com/clubworldcup/news/y=2017/m=10/news=draw-lays-out-path-to-club-world-cup-glory-2911298.html|url-status=dead|archive-date=9 October 2017|title=Draw lays out path to Club World Cup glory|publisher=FIFA.com|date=9 October 2017}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.fifa.com/clubworldcup/news/y=2017/m=10/news=the-uae-2017-draw-explained-2910193.html|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20171008222107/http://www.fifa.com/clubworldcup/news/y=2017/m=10/news=the-uae-2017-draw-explained-2910193.html|url-status=dead|archive-date=8 October 2017|title=The UAE 2017 Draw explained|publisher=FIFA.com|date=6 October 2017}}</ref> At the time of the draw, the identity of the teams representing AFC, CAF, and CONMEBOL were not known.<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.fifa.com/clubworldcup/news/y=2017/m=10/news=follow-the-fifa-club-world-cup-draw-2911296.html|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20171008185725/http://www.fifa.com/clubworldcup/news/y=2017/m=10/news=follow-the-fifa-club-world-cup-draw-2911296.html|url-status=dead|archive-date=8 October 2017|title=Follow the FIFA Club World Cup draw|publisher=FIFA.com|date=8 October 2017}}</ref>

If a match was tied after normal playing time:<ref name="regulations"/>
*For elimination matches, [[extra time (association football)|extra time]] would be played. If still tied after extra time, a [[penalty shoot-out (association football)|penalty shoot-out]] would be held to determine the winners.
*For matches for fifth place and third place, extra time would not be played and a penalty shoot-out would be held to determine the winners.

